  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile settings, scvi_n200 RNA encoder, and transformer aggregation/weighted fusion achieve high accuracy (e.g., config_039: 0.724989). This experiment tests whether replacing scvi_n200 with scgpt (a newer RNA encoder) in the same high-performing architecture could further improve accuracy. It directly isolates the effect of the RNA encoder while maintaining other successful components, balancing exploitation of proven elements with exploration of a novel encoder."
